Subject: [PATCH] restore original frontend flow and native serialized data ABI

Upstream-base: 9046e67aa2077a7eb4ed6e28c9df3c1d3b368f84

Restore reconstructed frontend methods and inline game decisions verbatim.
Adapt only raw Wii FEN data to the native pointer/record ABI beneath the original
FEScene allocation, relocation, resource queue and scene-creation requests.
Retain native animation vtables, original arena backing/free endpoints, full-width
Bundle callback contexts and all authored playmode bits with their original switch.
Historical standalone helper files remain available to diagnostics only.

Refreshed for decomp 9046e67a: the frontend sources whose share edits this
patch undid keep their upstream text throughout, so it no longer touches them.

